  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Monster-_Fire_Mutant_Twins.jpg\" title=\"Fire Mutant Twins\"><img alt=\"Fire Mutant Twins\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/Monster-_Fire_Mutant_Twins.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Monster-_Fire_Mutant_Twins.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Fire Mutant Twins</div></div></div>\n<p><b>Race:  </b>Mutant\n</p><p><b>Class:  </b> Fighter\n</p><p>Twins are small creatures, connected in pairs.  They often come in crowds.  \n</p><p><b>Tip:</b> <i>They seem particularly difficult to kill for small creatures, presumably because you have to kill both of the pair.  If you ignore them as small and helpless, you can get in trouble!</i>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Some_Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Some Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Burning Twins\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Tainted_Grove\" title=\"Tainted Grove\">Tainted Grove</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Overlord's_Sepulcher\" title=\"Overlord's Sepulcher\">Overlord's Sepulcher</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Forest\" title=\"Dark Forest\">Dark Forest</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shadow Twins\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Vexation </a>,The <a href=\"/wiki/Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"Mutanous Malaise\">Mutanous Malaise</a>, lvl 6-7\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fire Mutant Twins\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror_Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror Dome\">Algor's Terror Dome</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Embercore_Path\" title=\"Embercore Path\">Embercore Path </a>,The <a href=\"/wiki/Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"Mutanous Malaise\">Mutanous Malaise</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ice Mutant Twins\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's Misfortune</a> levels 5-7\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
